question:
You are developing a text-processing solution that calls the Azure AI Language `RecognizeEntities` operation. You have the following function:

```csharp
static void GetEntities(TextAnalyticsClient client, string text)
{
    var response = client.RecognizeEntities(text);
    foreach (var entity in response.Value)
        Console.WriteLine(entity.Text);
}
```

You call the function with this string as the second argument:

`Our tour of London included a visit to Buckingham Palace`

What will the function return?

